// Agent V021 — Negative Review Followup SMS Responder
// SMS conversation type: Negative Review Followup  (slug: negative_review_followup)
// Signal in:  SMS_RESPONSE_NEGATIVE_REVIEW_FOLLOWUP
// Signal out: CUSTOMER_SMS_REPLY (escalates by emitting CUSTOMER_SMS_ESCALATE
